type     CT3   C        4         3
type     CT2   C        4         2
type     HC    H        1         *

bond      harmonic  CT3  CT3   268.0   1.529
bond      harmonic  CT3  CT2   268.0   1.529
bond      harmonic  CT2  CT2   268.0   1.529
