angle     harmonic  CT3  CT2  CT2    58.35  112.7
angle     harmonic  CT3  CT2  CT3    58.35  112.7
angle     harmonic  X    CT2  HC     37.5   110.7
angle     harmonic  HC   CT2  HC     33.0   107.8
angle     harmonic  X    CT3  HC     37.5   110.7
angle     harmonic  HC   CT3  HC     33.0   107.8
angle     harmonic  CT2  CT3  HC     37.5   110.7

dihedral   opls   X    CT2  CT2  X      1.740  -0.157   0.279   0.000
dihedral   opls   X    CT2  CT3  X      0.000   0.000   0.366   0.000
